          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "The PHLX’s implementation of these rule changes will be consistent with the June 1995 conversion schedule which the Stock Clearing Corporation of Philadelphia and National Securities Clearing Corporation have developed for industry use. The schedule is as follows:",
