        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "If the Commission determines to alter the exemptions currently provided in Rule 15c6–1, the PHLX may need to submit additional rule amendments. It is intended that the proposed rule change will become effective the same date as Commission Rule 15c6–1.",
