            [
              438.0,
              1262.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "The proposed change also is consistent with Commission Rule 15c6–1 which will require brokers or dealers to settle most securities transactions no later than the third business day after the date of the contract unless otherwise expressly agreed to by the parties at the time of the transaction.",
